an><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7352caca1960999c\" href=\"?note=7352caca1960999c\" title=\"88-df-model\">88-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景理论为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"da378af7f2f57e43\" href=\"?note=da378af7f2f57e43\" title=\"88-df-signature-size\">88-df-signature-size</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\preceq_S\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\preceq_S\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2b85c726d5a8ee87\" href=\"?note=2b85c726d5a8ee87\" title=\"88-df-elementary-substructure\">88-df-elementary-substructure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是要求保留的参数集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是候选基数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|\">\\(|X|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{free}_S,\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{free}_S,\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>；可数语法联系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"c03ee71a93771472\" href=\"?note=c03ee71a93771472\" title=\"88-lem-countable-syntax\">88-lem-countable-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是候选句子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"7352caca1960999c\" href=\"?note=7352caca1960999c\" title=\"88-df-model\">88-df-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall S,\\mathfrak A,X,\\kappa\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\max\\{|X|,\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0\\}\n\\leq\\kappa\\leq|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)|\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathfrak B\\preceq_S\\mathfrak A\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall S,\\mathfrak A,X,\\kappa\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\max\\{|X|,\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0\\}\n\\leq\\kappa\\leq|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)|\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathfrak B\\preceq_S\\mathfrak A\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\forall S,\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_0)\\land\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\Sigma\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak M_0))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\forall S,\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_0)\\land\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\Sigma\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak M_0))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向下定理的证明。先在原论域中选取基数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>、包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的集合。反复添加全部常量的解释、函数符号在当前参数元组上的值，以及每个带当前参数且在原结构中成立的存在公式的一个见证。公式数与每轮参数元组数均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，故每轮及可数轮之并仍至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>；初始集合保证最终恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>最终集合对全部函数解释封闭，诱导出子结构。对公式结构归纳，原子式由诱导解释保持；布尔分支直接保持；存在量词的正向由已添加的见证保证，反向由子结构中的见证及归纳假设保证。因此得到初等子结构，而不仅是满足某些孤立句子的任意小结构。</p>\n<p>对第二个断言，先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的一个模型。若它有限，直接使用；若它无限，在第一个断言中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\emptyset\">\\(X=\\emptyset\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\aleph_0\">\\(\\kappa=\\aleph_0\\)</span>。所得初等子结构保持全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 句子。保留原文件的可数模型结论，同时补上真正的向下形式；所有大小均指实际论域或非逻辑符号集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-signature-size","status":"resolved","id":"da378af7f2f57e43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-signature-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-countable-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"c03ee71a93771472","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-countable-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"2b85c726d5a8ee87","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target"